 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Zacchaeus was a little man",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A rich man, short and small",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He could not see when Jesus came",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The crowd was much too tall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he ran ahead, he ran ahead",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And climbed up in a tree",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Up in the leaves of the sycamore",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Jesus I can see",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zacchaeus, hurry down",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For today I must stay at your house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zacchaeus, hurry down",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came to seek and to save what was lost",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He hurried down with a happy face",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He welcomed him with joy",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people grumbled, grumble, grumble",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What a sinful man",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Jesus went in through his door",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not stay away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He loved the man that no one loved",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And came to stay that day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zacchaeus, hurry down",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For today I must stay at your house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zacchaeus, hurry down",
